+ *   GENI SPI uses ABL's SE firmware and packing; full-duplex FIFO transfers
+ *   with the opcode in M_CMD0[31:27] as in the I2C driver. Reads follow the
+ *   NT36xxx SPI framing (address & 0x7f, one dummy byte). The event buffer
+ *   page (0xff page select) is not set yet, and the report layout is a
